{
  "name": "Crypto Price Alert Lite (free, by Relaybrook)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Crypto Price Alert Lite (free)\nBy **Relaybrook**. Checks a short coin list against your own price thresholds and sends **one** message when a coin crosses one.\n\n**Try it now:** click *Execute workflow*. Test mode is ON, so it uses sample prices and only shows the alert in **Preview (test mode)**. No keys, no accounts.\n\n**Go live**\n1. In **Config** edit `watchlist` (one coin per line, CoinGecko ids).\n2. Set where alerts go (see the note on the right).\n3. Set `test_mode = false`, save, and *Publish/Activate*. The schedule runs every 15 min.\n\nEach rule alerts once, then re-arms after the price moves back across the line, so you are not pinged every 15 minutes.\n\nPrice data by CoinGecko (free, no API key).",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "6c80a72c-ca56-5ac0-bcda-4d1dac7e1369",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### watchlist format\n```\nbitcoin: above 70000, below 60000\nethereum: below 2000\n```\nUse CoinGecko coin ids (the id is in the coin's URL on coingecko.com, e.g. `the-open-network` for TON). Prices are in `vs_currency` (default usd).",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 340
      },
      "id": "32b27203-503e-5281-bb39-d858456e03d6",
      "name": "Watchlist help",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Where alerts go\nTest mode never sends anything. With `test_mode = false`:\n- **Webhook** (Discord, Slack, or any URL): paste it into `webhook_url`. `webhook_format` = discord | slack | json.\n- **Telegram**: create a bot with @BotFather, add a Telegram credential in **Send Telegram**, right-click it -> *Activate*, and fill `telegram_chat_id`.\nNo webhook and no chat id? Nothing is sent.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 400
      },
